DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240909T160000
DESCRIPTION:Edgewood CrossFit is a new afterschool program for 6th-8th grad
 e students who want to learn healthy habits\, grow stronger\, and learn ne
 w athletic skills with guidance from a coach. We will meet every Monday an
 d Wednesday from 2:30 - 4 pm in the EJHS weight room. Any students interes
 ted in joining must fill out the interest form sent via email. Daily atten
 dance check-in will be required. Classes will be capped at 16 each day. Fo
 r more information\, visit Coach Randi or Mr. Sparks in the weight room.Pa
 rents\, please have your child fill out the interest form below if they ar
 e planning to attend. Thank you!Edgewood CrossFit Student Interest Form
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Edgewood CrossFit
