 all GLOW PARTY (2:30-5 PM at EJHS)! We will have a DJ in the gym and will 
 be selling pizza\, glow items\, candy\, and drinks in the cafeteria. All p
 roceeds go directly back to support EJHS students and teachers through you
 r EJHS PTO\; this event is open to EJHS students only. Pre-sale tickets ar
 e $6--if you purchase a ticket with cash at the door it will be $7. All p
 re-sale tickets will be handed out to EJHS students prior to the dance to 
 make entry faster (a benefit of pre-purchasing)!https://edgewoodschools.fo
 rmstack.com/forms/ejhsglow2024
