 ks\, CANE’S CHICKEN (!)\, theme/glow items for sale and our favorite res
 ident DJ will be in the gym.Presale tickets are open now – 2/23. Buying 
 in advance truly helps us plan most effectively AND allows your child fast
 er entry to the dance.We also do need help with donations and limited volu
 nteers if you’re able as well. Dances are our main form of fundraising 
 each year at EJHS\, so any and all support is so greatly appreciated! All
  proceeds go directly back to supporting EJHS students and teachers throug
 h your EJHS PTO
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Spring Dance
END:VEVENT
