UID:44ffb6c3-5c45-503b-9309-cb9a7979dac8
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250409T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250409T210000
DESCRIPTION:1) Registration – The cost of the physical is $25 plus transa
 ction fee and can be purchased through EventLink to complete your registra
 tion. We are only taking payment via EventLink for this event so paying ah
 ead of time is important.Edgewood Physical Registration LinkOpen the link.
 Select “2025 Physical Night (April 9th\, 2025)”.Select one of three ti
 me slots. There is a cap on the number of physicals we can process in an e
 vening\, when we hit our maximum capacity for that time slot\, it will not
  be available.2) Final Forms – We have partnered with Final Forms (see l
 etter) to create a better system in handling athletic physicals and creati
 ng a student safety tool for our coaches\, athletic trainers\, and athleti
 c administrators. All athletes will be required to have a Final Forms acco
 unt. Please use your student’s school issued email when creating your st
 udent’s account. This is how the coaches and school officials will commu
 niate with your athlete about importation information.So what do I need to
  do before the EHS Physicals Night?– If you HAVE Final Forms\, you shoul
 d sign in and update your information for your athlete.– If you DO NOT h
 ave Final Forms\, follow the Parent Playbook to set up your account.(5th
  Grade Parents: We are aware FinalForms will not allow you to select 5th g
 rade. We ask that you do one of the two things: 1 – select 6th grade and
  the office will update your students account to indicate the correct grad
 e. OR 2 – Send a copy of your student’s physical to Mrs. Norris at jno
 rris@rbbschools.net if you plan to go somewhere else to complete the physi
 cal. We will then notify you when FinalForms is available for registraion.
 )
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:2025 Athletic Physical Night
END:VEVENT
