DTSTAMP:20260805T031613Z
UID:e877b269-87bb-5272-b7d8-9927a34b1cbe
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250801T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250801T160000
DESCRIPTION:Edgewood Junior High School is pleased to offer Colts Round Up 
 exclusively for incoming 6th graders and new students! This experience is 
 a 2-hour orientation that is led by Edgewood Junior High School staff and 
 Student Council members. Adults\, we apologize that this is a students-onl
 y event\, but you may join your student at 4:00 for Open House.Location an
 d Time:Edgewood Junior High School\, Students enter through the Entrance 1
 .Friday\, August 1st from 2:00 p.m. – 4:00 p.m. Doors open at 1:45 p.m.
  Parents are invited to join at 4:00 for the EJHS Open House. Take note 
 that 4:00 p.m. - 5:00 p.m. is the busiest time for EJHS Open House. Please
  feel free to pick up your student and return with them at a later time if
  you’d prefer less of a crowd.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Colt's Round Up
END:VEVENT
