DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250801T190000
DESCRIPTION:Enter through Entrance 2 (North side closest to the baseball fi
 eld)The building will be open from 3:30-6:00 pm for all students and famil
 ies\, for unstructured time\, which will allow for ample locker-decorating
  time. Please remember that nothing can go on the outside of the locker an
 d there are to be NO STICKERS anywhere on the locker.Additionally\, please
  note that Chromebooks will be passed out during the first week of school.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Open House
END:VEVENT
