DESCRIPTION:The EJHS PTO invites you to join us on August 29th at the EJHS 
 Fall GLOW PARTY (2:30-5 PM at EJHS)! We will have a DJ in the gym and will
  be selling pizza\, glow items\, candy\, and drinks in the cafeteria. All 
 proceeds go directly back to support EJHS students and teachers through yo
 ur EJHS PTO\; this event is open to EJHS students only. Pre-sale tickets a
 re $6--if you purchase a ticket with cash at the door\, it will be $7. Al
 l pre-sale tickets will be handed out to EJHS students before the dance to
  make entry faster (a benefit of pre-purchasing)!
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS GLOW PARTY
