DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250915T153000
DESCRIPTION:  Are you fast with your fingers and love a challenge? Come jo
 in The Speed Cube Club — We will have our callout meeting on Monday\,
  September 15th\, right after school until 3:30 PM! Speed cubing is the 
 art of solving a Rubik’s Cube as fast as possible — it’s fun\, com
 petitive\, and seriously satisfying. No experience needed — just curios
 ity and a willingness to learn. See you there! 🟦​🟩​🟥​🟨
 ​
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Speed Cube Club
END:VEVENT
