BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Edgewood Junior High School
DTSTAMP:20260805T031613Z
UID:96b2949d-4961-5997-95f5-41cae686eb4d
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260227T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260227T170000
DESCRIPTION:The EJHS Student Council and PTO are excited to invite all EJHS
  students to the winter dance "Golden Hour." Join us for music\, friends
 \, Chick-fil-A nuggets\, and all the good vibes as we turn the afternoon i
 nto something unforgettable. This after-school event will take place on F
 riday\, February 27\, from 2:30-5 pm at EJHS. As a reminder\, this dance
  is a fundraiser and all proceeds go directly back to support EJHS studen
 ts and teachers through your EJHS PTO.Online tickets are available here f
 or $6\, now through Friday\, February 20! Students who pre-purchase their 
 tickets online will be given their ticket at lunch on the day of the danc
 e\, allowing for quicker dance entry. The week of the dance\, cash tick
 ets will be available for $7 during lunches and at the door of the dance.
  Students\, dress for the Golden Hour if you want—or come exactly as yo
 u are. Whether you step fully into your golden era or keep it comfy\, you
 ’ll fit right in! You may come to school dressed for the dance. Just re
 member that costumes are not allowed.More information about the dance\, p
 ick-up logistics\, and possible VIP pick-up/parking options will be sent o
 ut as we get closer to the dance! So\, save the date\, bring your crew\,
  and come catch the Golden Hour with us! It’s going to be low stress\, g
 reat fun\, and definitely worth staying after the bell. See you there!
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:EJHS Golden Hour Dance
END:VEVENT
