BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Edgewood Junior High School
DTSTAMP:20260805T031613Z
UID:fd5f15f0-ce91-5fec-bcfd-da49004a6a24
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260803T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260803T170000
DESCRIPTION:Edgewood Junior High School is pleased to offer Colts Round Up 
 exclusively for incoming 6th graders and new students! This experience is 
 a 2-hour orientation that is led by Edgewood Junior High School staff and 
 Student Council members. Adults\, we apologize that this is a students-onl
 y event\; you may join your student at 5:00 p.m. for Open House.Location a
 nd Time:Edgewood Junior High School\; students enter through Entrance 1.Mo
 nday\, August 3rd from 3:00 p.m. – 5:00 p.m. Doors open at 2:45 p.m. P
 arents are invited to join at 5:00 for the EJHS Open House. Take note tha
 t 5:00 p.m. - 6:00 p.m. is the busiest time for EJHS Open House. Please fe
 el free to pick up your student and return with them later if you’d pref
 er a smaller crowd.
